Title: "Description"
Id: "bfcf30b0-219a-4a67-8136-15da33e31919"

Text: "```mlg-fragment
[LabelHeader]?
description: <OpenText>
```

The description is quoted prose that may span multiple lines. The renderer
unindents it and shows it above the card as page prose; the card details refer
to it as `<see above>`."
Id: "905a440c-83f0-4f80-8dd9-32577cb1c039"
